==Irish==

===Etymology 1===
Earlier {{term|sdór|lang=ga}} and {{term|stór|lang=ga}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|ga}} {{term|instauro|instaurō|lang=la}}.  Cognate with English [[store]].

====Noun====
{{infl|ga|noun|g=m}}

# [[goods]], [[provisions]]
# [[wealth]], [[value]]
# [[affluence]]

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|ML.|ga}} {{term|historia||lang=la|narrative, illustration, story of a building}}, from {{etyl|la|ga}}.  Cognate with English [[storey]], [[story]].

====Noun====
{{infl|ga|noun|g=m}}

# [[storey]], [[story]]

